1 NAME Viridis /Visconti/
2 GIVN Viridis
2 SURN Visconti
2 _MARNM Visconti
1 SEX F
1 BURI
2 PLAC Sittich, Karnten, Austria
2 ADDR
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1351
2 ADDR
3 CITY Milan
3 STAE Lombardy
