2 CONT =Della Scala (Scalighieri) family=
2 CONT One Balduino, +1166, Consul of Verona in 1147 had issue:
2 CONT * ...
2 CONT *A2. Isnardino, +after 1186
2 CONT ** ...
2 CONT **B2. Leonardino/Sigiberto, +after 19.12.1228
2 CONT *** ...
2 CONT ***C2. Iacopino, Vicario Imperiale in Oneglia, Podeste di Cerea, +after 21.9.1248; <br> 1m: Margherita Giustiniani; <br> 2m: Elisa Superbi
2 CONT ****D1. [1m.] Manfredo, Bishop of Verona (1241-56), *1215, +1256
2 CONT ****D2. Leonardino also Mastino I, Podeste di Cerea 1258, Podeste di Verona I.1259, Capitano del Popolo di Verona (Lord of Verona) (1262-77), Podeste di Pavia 1267, +killed, Verona 26.10.1277; m.Giglia/Zilia N
2 CONT ***** ...
2 CONT ****D3. '''Alberto I, Podeste di Verona''' (1275-76), Lord of Verona (1277-1301), +Verona 3.9.1301; <br> m.before 1263 Verde di Salizzole (+25.12.1306)
2 CONT *****E1. Constanza, +Mantova 1306; 1m: 1289 Obizzo II d'Este, Signore di Ferrara e Marchese d'Este (*1247 +13.2.1293); 2m: 1299 Guido Bonaccolosi Lord of Mantova (+Mantova 24.1.1309)
2 CONT *****E2. Bartolomeo I, Lord of Verona and Vicenza (1301-04), +7/8.3.1304; 1m: Constanza of Antiochia, dau.of Corrado Count of Celano and Alba by Beatrice Lancia, great-niece of Emperor Friedrich II; 2m: Onesta N
2 CONT ****** ...
2 CONT *****E3. Barbara, +1297; m.Giovanni I da Carrara Podeste di Belluno (+after 1312)
2 CONT *****E4. Alboino I, Lord of Verona and Vicenza (1304-11), *ca 1284, +Verona 28.10.1311; 1m: 1298 Caterina Visconti; 2m: 1.1.1306 Beatrice da Corregio, dau.of Giberto Lord of Parma and Corregio by Elena from Marquess Malaspina (+af
2 CONC ter 1311); for his issue see HERE
2 CONT *****E5. Canfrancesco I called Cangrande I, Lord of Verona and Vicenza (1308-29), Lord of Padova (1318-29), Lord of Belluno and Feltre (1322-29), celebrated patron of the arts and great general, *9.3.1291, +Treviso 18.7.1329; m.Gi
2 CONC ovanna of Antiochia, dau.of Corrado Count of Celano and Alba by Beatrice Lancia (+1352), great-niece of Emperor Friedrich II
2 CONT ****** ...
2 CONT *****E6. Caterina; m.Bailardino di Nogarole Vicario Imperiale nella Marca di Verona (+ca 1330)
2 CONT *****E7. [illegitimate] Giuseppe, Abbot of San Zeno in Verona, +5.11.1314
2 CONT ****** ...
2 CONT ****D4. Federico called Bocca, +k.a.near Villafranca 1269
2 CONT ***** ...
2 CONT ****D5. Guido, +XI/XII.1273
