2 CONT b)         GIOVANNA (-[1302/05]).  The Cronica Fratris Salimbene de Adam refers to the wife of "primogenitus Aço" as "parentela papa Nicholai tertii natione Romani"[573].  The Chronicon Estense records the marriage in Sep 1282 in 
2 CONC Ferrara of "domini Azonis filii domini marchionis Obizonis Estensis" and "domina Johanna de Ursinis de Roma"[574].  
2 CONT
