1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Heinrich van Cuijck, Burggraf von Leiden1,2,3
2 CONT Last Edited	21 Feb 2013
2 CONT M, #25788, b. circa 1231, d. 12 January 1319
2 CONT Father	Dirk (Dietrich I) van Cuijk, Burggraf van Leiden2 b. c 1205, d. 1260
2 CONT Mother	Christina van Oegstgeest2 b. c 1206, d. 1271
2 CONT Heinrich van Cuijck, Burggraf von Leiden was born circa 1231 at of Grave, Netherlands. He married Halewine von Egmond, daughter of Wilhelm II, Herr von Egmond and Ada, circa 1260.1,2,3 Heinrich van Cuijck, Burggraf von Leiden died
2 CONC  on 12 January 1319.1,2
2 CONT '''Family'''
2 CONT Halewine von Egmond d. a 1276
2 CONT '''Child'''
2 CONT Alveradis van Cuijck+2,3 b. c 1265, d. a 1310
2 CONT Internal Sourcing
