2 CONT 9.         CARACOSA Fiesco (-after Feb 1285).  The testament of "Bonifacius marchio de Carreto", dated Feb 1285, made bequests to "Percivallio de Lavania cognato meo…Aloysiæ de Canellis domicellæ Caracossæ uxoris meæ…sororis prædi
2 CONC cti D. Percevalli…"[433].  
