2 CONC st marriage contract is dated 10 Aug 1411[714].  A charter dated 17 Jun 1467 records a settlement concerning “la succession d’Antoinette de Saluces” between “ses enfants Sassenage, Jacques sgr de Veurey, Marguerite et Jeanne” and 
2 CONC “son fils du second lit Bertrand de la Baume”[715].  
