1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ====FMG (23 July 2025) [https://fmg.ac/https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/MONFERRATO,%20SALUZZO,%20SAVONA.htm#AdelasiaMonferratoMManfredoIISaluzzo Monferrato, Saluzzo]
