2 CONT The Life Summary of Elisa Alessine Menzia
2 CONT
2 CONT When Elisa Alessine Menzia d'Este was born on 4 April 1210, in Este, Padova, Veneto, Italy, her father, Aldobrandino I d' Este Marchese d'Este, was 20 and her mother, Regina d' Este della Scala, was 20. She had at least 1 son and 
2 CONC 1 daughter with Marquis Giorgio "George" (Del Vasto) di Ceva Marquis de Ceva. She died on 29 August 1258, in Ceva, Cuneo, Piedmont, Italy, at the age of 48.
