1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *'''Mary FitzAlan1,2,3,4,5
2 CONT *'''F, d. 29 August 1396
2 CONT *Father     Sir Edmund FitzAlan, 9th Earl Arundel, Chief Justice of North & South Wales1,2,6,4,5 b. 1 May 1285, d. 17 Nov 1326
2 CONT *Mother     Alice de Warren1,2,6 b. c 1287, d. bt 1330 - 23 May 1338
2 CONT *'''     Mary FitzAlan married Sir John le Strange, 4th Lord Strange of Blackmere''', son of Sir John le Strange, 2nd Lord Strange of Blackmere and Ankaret le Boteler, '''before 1354; They had 1 son''' (John, 5th Lord Strange) '''
2 CONC and one daughter''', Ankaret (wife of Sir Richard, 4th Lord Talbot & of Sir Thomas Neville, Lord Furnival).1,2,3,4,5 '''Mary FitzAlan died on 29 August 1396.1,2
2 CONT *'''Family      Sir John le Strange, 4th Lord Strange of Blackmere''' b. 13 Jan 1332, d. 12 May 1361
2 CONT *'''Children
2 CONT **(Sir John le Strange, 5th Baron Strange of Blackmere+7,2 b. c 1353, d. 3 Aug 1375
