2 CONT *'''     Mary FitzAlan was the daughter of''' Edmund Fitzalan, 9th Earl of Arundel and Alice de Warenne.3,4,5,1 '''She married John Lestrange, 4th Lord Strange (of Blackmere)''', son of John Lestrange, 2nd Lord Strange (of Blackme
2 CONC re).1
2 CONT *'''Children of Mary FitzAlan and John Lestrange, 4th Lord Strange (of Blackmere)
