2 CONC nuscript which narrates the descents of the founders of Lanthony Abbey records the marriage of “Johannes de Bohun comes”, son of “Humfredus octavus”, and “Aliciam filiam domini Edmundi comitis Arundeliæ” after the death of his fat
2 CONC her, and her burial at Walden[136].  m (Papal dispensation Feb 1325) as his first wife, JOHN de Bohun Earl of Hereford and Essex, Earl of Arundel, son of HUMPHREY de Bohun Earl of Hereford and Essex & his wife Elizabeth of England
2 CONC  (St Clements 23 Nov 1306-Kirkby Thore, co. Westmoreland 20 Jan 1336, bur Stratford Abbey near London).''' 
