2 CONT **Aline	 —	20 January 1386	Married Roger le Strange, 5th Baron Strange of Knockin[35]
2 CONT **'''Alice	 —	1326	Married John de Bohun, 5th Earl of Hereford
2 CONT **Katherine	 —	d. 1375/76	Married (1) Henry Hussey, 2nd Baron Hussey, (2) **Andrew Peverell
