2 CONT Lady Alice Fitzalan
2 CONT
2 CONT Father:      Edmund Fitzalan, 2nd Earl of Arundel (1285-1326)
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother:      Alice de Warenne (~1285-1338)
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth:            abt 1310
2 CONT
2 CONT Date of birth estimated from the marriage of her parents in 1305, the date of birth of her oldest brother about 1313, the fact that she was the eldest daughter, and the date of her own marriage in 1325.
2 CONT
2 CONT Death:      abt 1329
2 CONT
2 CONT Date of death estimated from the fact that her husband was remarried before February 1331.
2 CONT
2 CONT Burial:      Walden Abbey, Essex
2 CONT
2 CONT “Et Alicia Arundell uxor ejus sepelitur apud Walden, in medio capellae beatae Mariae” [Walden Abbey Cartulary].1
2 CONT
2 CONT Occupation:      Countess of Hereford & Essex 1325-c.1329
2 CONT
