2 CONT
2 CONT John de Bohun, 5th Earl of Hereford & Essex
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage:      22 Feb 1325
2 CONT
2 CONT Date is of marriage dispensation: “8 Kal. Mar. Avignon.  To John de Boun, son of Humphrey earl of Hereford. Dispensation, at the request of Edmund, earl of Arundel, to marry one of the daughters of the said Edmund, they being rela
2 CONC ted in the fourth degree.  (f.257d.)” [CPapR 1305-1342, p. 242].
