2 CONT      John De Segrave , Baron 
2 CONT
2 CONT      John married Margaret Plantagenet , Duchess of Norfolk, daughter of Thomas of Brotherton  , Earl of Norfolk and Alice Halys. 
2 CONT
2 CONT      John De Segrave , Baron died on 20 March 1353.1 
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of John De Segrave , Baron and Margaret Plantagenet ,
