2 CONC r 25 Oct 1349).  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' secondly (1352) as his first wife, OTTO Herzog von Braunschweig-Grubenhagen, son of HEINRICH II "dem Jungen/dem Griechischen" Herzog von Braunschweig-Grubenhagen & his first wife Jutta von Brandenburg ([1320]-[1 Dec 1398/1
2 CONC 3 May 1399]).  Principe di Tarento and Achaia 1376.  
