2 CONT [edit] Family and Children
2 CONT
2 CONT John of Berry had the following issue by his first wife, Joanna of Armagnac (1346–1387):[2]
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Charles of Berry, Count of Montpensier (1362–1382)
2 CONT
2 CONT     * John de Valois, Count of Montpensier, (1363–1402), married firstly Princess Catherine of France, daughter of Charles V, King of France and secondly Anne de Bourbon-La Marche
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Louis of Berry (1364–1383)
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Bonne of Berry (1365–1435), married Amadeus VII of Savoy and Bernard VII, Count of Armagnac
2 CONT
