2 CONT Edward was born at Windsor Castle. He imprisoned his mother and executed her
2 CONT lover Roger de Mortimer. He died at Sheen Palace from a stroke.
2 CONT He had 6 sons and 5 daughters.
2 CONT King of England from Jan 25, 1327 till 1377.
2 CONT Created the Order of the Garter Oct 26, 1326.
2 CONT King of France 1340. His claim to France through his mother started the 100
2 CONT year war.
2 CONT This individual was found on GenCircles at: http://www.gencircles.com/users/mpbennett/1/data/5150[mpbennett-1-5154.ged]
