1 NOTE Founder of the House of York which fought in the Wars of the Roses. [GADD.GED]
2 CONT
2 CONT Made Master of the Mewhouse and of Hawkes Feire of his Veneirie and Master of the Game. Wrote a treatise on Hunting and was noted for his skill. [THELMA.GED]
