2 CONT '''Ulrich V 'the Beloved', Graf von Wurttemberg-Stuttgart was born in 1413.1 He married Margarethe von Kleve''', daughter of Adolph I, Duke of Cleeves and Mary (Claudia) of Burgundy, '''on 29 January 1441 at Stuttgart, Baden-Württ
2 CONC emberg, Germany.1,4,5 Ulrich V 'the Beloved', Graf von Wurttemberg-Stuttgart married Elisabeth of Bavaria''', daughter of Heinrich IV 'the Rich', Duke of Bavaria-Landshut and Margarethe of Austria, '''on 8 February 1445 at Stuttga
2 CONC rt, Baden-Württemberg, Germany.1 Ulrich V 'the Beloved', Graf von Wurttemberg-Stuttgart married Margaret of Savoy''', daughter of Amadeus VIII (Pope Felix V), Duke of Savoy and Mary of Burgundy, '''on 11 November 1453 at Stuttgart
2 CONC , Baden-Württemberg, Germany.1 Ulrich V 'the Beloved', Graf von Wurttemberg-Stuttgart died on 1 September 1480 at Leonberg, Böblingen, Baden-Württemberg, Germany; Buried at Stuttgart.'''1,5
