4 CONT Countess Johanna of Pfirt (Jeanne de Ferrette) (* 1300 in Basel , † November 15th 1351 in Vienna ) was by marriage Duchess of Austria from the House of Habsburg .
4 CONT Johanna is the eldest daughter of Count Ulrich III. (1281-1324) of Pfirt and his wife Princess Joan of Montbéliard (1284-1349), daughter of Count Reinald of Chalon-sur-Saône and granddaughter Duke Hugh IV of Burgundy , was born.
