2 CONT Friedrich Markgraf von Hohenzollern was born in 1424. He was the son of Friedrich I Kurfürst von Brandenburg and Elisabeth Prinzessin von Bayern-Landshut. (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Agnes von Pommern in 1449.
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in 1463. (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT Friedrich Markgraf von Hohenzollern also went by the nick-name of Friedrich 'the Fat'. (1) He was a member of the House of Hohenzollern. (1) He gained the title of Markgraf von Brandenburg in 1440. (1)
