2 CONT Agnes Bernauer Famous Augsburgers
2 CONT
2 CONT ca. 1410 – October 12, 1435
2 CONT
2 CONT Although Agnes Bernauer’s birthplace and social origin are not documented, it is said that she is the daughter of the barber and bathhouse owner Kaspar Bernauer. At a jousting tournament in Augsburg, she met Duke Albert III of Bav
2 CONC aria and not long thereafter, against the wishes of his family, they were wed in a private ceremony. '''They had a daughter''' and lived in Vohburg and Straubing.
