2 CONT '''GUILLAUME de Faucigny'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===From Medlands:===
2 CONT
2 CONT http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/BURGUNDY%20Kingdom.htm#GuillaumeFaucignydied1124B
2 CONT
2 CONT son of LOUIS Seigneur de Faucigny & his wife Tetberga --- (-1124 or after).  His parentage is confirmed by the charter dated 4 Sep 1119 by which "Wido…Gebennensis episcopus" donated "ecclesiam de Condominio" for the souls of "…Gui
2 CONC llelmi fratris mei…" to Cluny[964].  Seigneur de Faucigny.  "Aymo comes Gebennensis et filius meus Giroldus" founded the priory of Chamonix by undated charter, dated to [1088/99], signed by "uterini fratres comitis, Willelmus Fulc
2 CONC iniacus et Amedeus…"[965].  
2 CONT
2 CONT m OTTILIE, daughter of ---.  Her marriage is confirmed by the charter dated 4 Sep 1119 by which "Wido…Gebennensis episcopus" donated "ecclesiam de Condominio" for the souls of "…Guillelmi fratris mei et filiorum eius Rodulfi, Ludo
2 CONC ici, Raimundi et episcorum Geraldi Lausannensi et Amadei Morianensis nepotum meorum et matris eorum Utilie…" to Cluny[966].  
2 CONT
2 CONT Guillaume & his wife had five children
