2 CONT Count Gerold of Geneva - was born about 1012, lived in Geneva, Switzerland and died about 1045 . He was the son of Count Simon I of Gevena and Countess Bertha of Flanders.
2 CONT
2 CONT Count Gerold married Countess Gisela of Geneva. Countess Gisela was born about 1020, lived in Switzerland.
2 CONT
2 CONT   Then Count Gerold married Thietburge. Thietburge was born about 1025, lived in Geneva, Geneva, Switzerland.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children with Countess Gisela of Geneva (Quick Family Chart)
2 CONT
2 CONT i. 	Joan de Geneva was born about 1040, lived in Geneva, Switzerland.
2 CONT
2 CONT Joan married Count Amadeo II of Savoy. Count Amadeo was born about 1032, lived in Geneva, Switzerland. He was the son of Eudes Savoy and Adelais Suza. He died on 26 Jan 1080 . 
