2 CONT      Cecilia di Carrara was the daughter of Francis di Carrara, Duca di Padua. She married Wenzel II Kurfürst von Sachsen, son of Rudolf I Herzog von Sachsen-Wittenberg and Kunigarde of Poland, in 1367. She died between 1430 and 1
2 CONC 434.
