2 CONT **by 2nd JEANNE de Châtillon: childless
2 CONT **by 3rd MARGIT of Hungary
2 CONT *** 5. DEMETRIO
2 CONT *Wikipedia 2 wives and 4 children 
2 CONT **by 1st Helena del Bosco: 
2 CONT ***1. William VI, 
2 CONT ***2. Beatrice (∞Henry II del Carretto), ENRICO di Caretto
2 CONT ***3. Agnes of Montferrat (∞Henry of Flanders)
