2 CONT 4.         COMITA (-1218).  Fara names “Comita” as the fourth son of “Genuarius II Lacon, vulgo Gunari de Lacon appellatus”, adding that his father granted him “regiones Ogani et Anglobis”[608].  Judge of Torres.  “Comita...iudex 
2 CONC Turritanus et Maringnanus pater et filius...et ceteros filios nostros” agreed a convention with the commune of Genoa by undated charter, maybe dated to 1191[609].  “Maria de Thori” confirmed a donation to S. Salvatore di Camaldoli
2 CONC , with the consent of “donnu meu iudike Comita de Laccon et dessa mujere donna Agnesa regina et dessu fiju donnu Marine rege”, by charter dated 1 Jul 1210, which also records the separate consent by “Judike Comita de Laccon” of th
2 CONC e donation made by “domna Maria de Thori thia mea” naming her husband “donnu Petru de Maroniu”[610].  "Comita judex Turritanus" donated property to "Girardo" in the name of "nepotum meorum…Manfredo et Agnete filiis quondam Bonifac
2 CONC ii filii Manfredi marchionis de Saluciis et filie mee Maria" by charter dated 22 Jan 1215[611].  A charter dated 1216 records a convention between the commune of Genoa and “Comita...Iudex Turritanus et Marignanus pater et filius”[
2 CONC 612].  
2 CONT *m firstly as her second husband, SINISPELLA, widow of UC PONCE de Cevera Vizconde de Bas, daughter of BARISONE Judge of Arborea King of Sardinia & his first wife Pellegrina de Lacon.  Fara names “Spellam Arboreensem” as the wife 
2 CONC of “Comita II, Barisonis quartus filius”, and mother of “Marianum filium, filiasque Mariam et Pretiosam”[613].  This information has not been confirmed by primary source evidence.  
2 CONT *m secondly AGNESE di Saluzzo, daughter of MANFREDO II Marchese di Saluzzo & his wife Alasia di Monferrato (-after 31 Mar 1223).  “Maria de Thori” confirmed a donation to S. Salvatore di Camaldoli, with the consent of “donnu meu i
2 CONC udike Comita de Laccon et dessa mujere donna Agnesa regina et dessu fiju donnu Marine rege”, by charter dated 1 Jul 1210[614].  The primary source which confirms her parentage has not yet been identified.  Comita & his first wife 
2 CONC had [three] children: 
