2 CONT
2 CONT D2. [2m.] King PEDRO III "el Grande" of Aragon (1276-85/6) etc, King of Sicily (1282-85), (to which he was welcomed after the Angevins were expelled), *1239, +Villafranca del Penedes 11.11.1285; m.Montpellier 13.6.1262 Constance v
2 CONC on Hohenstaufen (*1249 +Barcelona 9.4.1302), dau.of King Manfredo of Sicily
