2 CONC a), dau.of Charles II King of Sicily; had issue:
2 CONT *A1. King PIETRO II of Sicily (1337-42), *1304, +Calataxibeta 15.8.1342; m.23.4.1322 Elisabeth of Carinthia (*ca 1298 +after 1347), dau.of Gf Otto II von Tirol
