2 CONT *     Elizabeth le Botiller was born circa 1345 at of Wemme, Whixall, Hinstock, & Loppington, Shropshire, England; Age 24 in 1369.2,3 She and Sir Robert de Ferrers, 1st Baron Ferrers of Wemme obtained a marriage license on 27 Sept
2 CONC ember 1369 at Acton Burnell, Shropshire, England; They had 1 son, Robert.2,4,3 Elizabeth le Botiller married Sir John Say before 24 November 1381.2,3 Elizabeth le Botiller married Sir Thomas Molington before 25 October 1398; Date 
2 CONC of Papal indult.5,2,3 Elizabeth le Botiller died on 19 June 1411; Requested to be buried in the Church of the Crutched Friars next to the Tower of London.2,3
2 CONT *''''''Family 1 Sir Robert de Ferrers, 1st Baron Ferrers of Wemme b. c 1350, d. 31 Dec 1380 
