2 CONT *http://books.google.com/books?id=p_yzpuWi4sgC&pg=PA134&lpg=PA134&dq=William+Le+Botiler+1331+1369&source=bl&ots=RRsL8LY785&sig=4pR8p011d4kCaF0_XJ3gFYlyQDc&hl=en&ei=DgHDTYPrBrDWiALoq9SZAw&sa=X&oi=book_result&ct=result&resnum=8&ved=
