2 CONC AN DE SUDELEY (222-35). (See Gen. Mag. 13:173-174; CP II 230-233; Wm.Salt Soc. n.s. vol. (1945-6), pp. 40-43).
2 CONT **  33. WILLIAM LE BOTILLER (or Botiler), Lord le Botiller of Wem and Oversely, b. Bef. 1331, d. 14 Aug. 1369, M.P. 1368-1369; m. bef. July 1343, Elizabeth, perh. Holand of Upholand. (CP II 230-235, V 320 chart, XII (1) 417-418; W
2 CONC m.Salt Soc. n.s. vol. (1945-6), pp. 42-43). Note: Elizabeth was not dau. of Robert, Lord Holand, since his daughter, Elizabeth, married by 1340 SIR HENRY FITZ ROGER (261-35). See refs. cited under that line & generation.
2 CONT ***''''''  34. ELIZABETH LE BOTILLER (or Botiler), of Wem and Oversley, b. bef. 1345, d. 19 June 1411, will 6 Jan. 1410/11, pro. June 1411: m. ca. 27 Sep. 1369, SIR ROBERT DE FERRERS (62-33). (CP II 230-235, V 320 chart; Wm.Salt S
2 CONC oc., cit.).
