2 CONT *http://wc.rootsweb.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=amandataylor&id=I11476
2 CONT *http://books.google.com/books?id=aCwwAAAAYAAJ&pg=PA302&lpg=PA302&dq=Henry+Hussey+1343&source=bl&ots=2DKMK5GA3U&sig=21lDXAO6lbOmiitvtLrqFSMgca4&hl=en&ei=Y9XVTMzuJY6-sAPbioWOCw&sa=X&oi=book_result&ct=result&resnum=6&ved=0CCIQ6AEwBT
2 CONC hG#v=onepage&q=Henry%20Hussey%201343&f=false
