2 CONT *************                                                              m. William Hoghton of Park Hall
2 CONT *************                                                            Their eldest son inherited Thurnham and took the name Dalton.
2 CONT *************                                                            ((b)) Dorothy Dalton of Faton and Aldcliffe who apparently married ...
