1 NAME John FitzAlan, 1st Baron Arundel
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1 AUG 1348
2 PLAC Arundel Castle
2 ADDR
3 CITY Sussex
3 CTRY England
1 BURI
2 DATE 1379
