2 CONT
2 CONT    2. ^ Fryde Handbook of British Chronology p. 286.
2 CONT
2 CONT    3. ^ a b Fryde Handbook of British Chronology p. 87.
2 CONT
2 CONT    4. ^ a b c d Fryde Handbook of British Chronology p. 233.
2 CONT
2 CONT    5. ^ a b c Wikisource-logo.svg "Lollards" in the 1913 Catholic Encyclopedia.
2 CONT
2 CONT    6. ^ 'Worst' historical Britons list, BBC 27 December 2005.
2 CONT
2 CONT    7. ^ Are these the 10 Worst Britons?, Independent 27 December 2005.
2 CONT
2 CONT    8. ^ Jack the Ripper is 'worst Briton', BBC 31 January 2006.
2 CONT
