2 CONT Do not confuse with https://www.geni.com/people/wife-of-Anthony-Browne/6000000039925853393
2 CONT
2 CONT Lady Eleanor FitzAlan was born circa 1355.1 She was the daughter of Richard FitzAlan, 3rd/10th Earl of Arundel and Lady Eleanor Plantagenet.1 She died before 1366.1
2 CONT
2 CONT ====Citations
2 CONT * [S11] Alison Weir, Britain's Royal Families: The Complete Genealogy (London, U.K.: The Bodley Head, 1999), page 79. Hereinafter cited as Britain's Royal Families.
2 CONT
