2 CONT '''     Sir Roger le Strange, 5th Lord Strange was born circa 1327 at of Knockin, Shropshire, England; Age 22 in 1349.2,7,14 He married Aline FitzAlan''', daughter of Sir Edmund FitzAlan, 9th Earl Arundel, Chief Justice of North &
2 CONC  South Wales and Alice de Warren, '''before July 1351; They had 5 sons''' (John, 6th Lord Strange; Sir Roger; Ebles, a cleric; Edward, a cleric; & Edmund, a cleric) '''and 2 daughters''' (Joan, wife of Sir Thomas Poynings, 5th Lor
2 CONC d St. John of Basing; & Lucy, wife of Sir William, 5th Lord Willoughby of Eresby).2,4,6,7,9,11,13,14,16 '''Sir Roger le Strange, 5th Lord Strange died on 23 August 1382 at Kenwick's Wood, Ellesmere, Shropshire, England.'''2,7,14
