1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ----
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sir John le Strange, 6th Lord Strange of Knokin''' was born circa 1352 at of Knockin, Shropshire, England; Age 30 in 1382, age 30, 31, 32, or 34 in 1386.2,4,10 A settlement for the marriage Sir John le Strange, 6th Lord Strange
2 CONC  of Knokin and Maud Mohun was made on 17 June 1369; They had 3 sons (Sir Richard, 7th Lord Strange of Knockin, Lord Mohun; Elbes; & Edmund) and at least 1 daughter (Aline, wife of Sir Edward Burnell).16,2,3,4,6,7,8,9,10,12 
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir John le Strange, 6th Lord Strange of Knokin died on 28 July 1397.2,4,10
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Origins 
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir Roger le Strange, 5th Lord Strange was born circa 1327 at of Knockin, Shropshire, England; Age 22 in 1349.  He married Aline FitzAlan, daughter of Sir Edmund FitzAlan, 9th Earl Arundel, Chief Justice of North & South Wales and
2 CONC  Alice de Warren.  They had 5 sons (John, 6th Lord Strange; Sir Roger; Ebles, a cleric; Edward, a cleric; & Edmund, a cleric) and 2 daughters (Joan, wife of Sir Thomas Poynings, 5th Lord St. John of Basing; & Lucy, wife of Sir Wil
2 CONC liam, 5th Lord Willoughby of Eresby).
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
