1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *'''Sir John le Strange, 4th Lord Strange of Blackmere1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8 
2 CONT *'''M, b. 13 January 1332, d. 12 May 1361
2 CONT *Father      Sir John le Strange, 2nd Lord Strange of Blackmere9,10 b. 25 Jan 1306, d. 21 Jul 1349
2 CONT *Mother      Ankaret le Boteler9,10 d. 8 Oct 1361
2 CONT *'''     Sir John le Strange, 4th Lord Strange of Blackmere was born on 13 January 1332 at of Whitchurch, Blackmere, Shropshire, England. He married Mary FitzAlan''', daughter of Sir Edmund FitzAlan, 9th Earl Arundel, Chief Justic
2 CONC e of North & South Wales and Alice de Warren, '''before 1354; They had 1 son''' (John, 5th Lord Strange) and '''one daughter''', Ankaret (wife of Sir Richard, 4th Lord Talbot & of Sir Thomas Neville, Lord Furnival).2,4,6,7,8 '''Si
2 CONC r John le Strange, 4th Lord Strange of Blackmere died on 12 May 1361 at of Braddock, Sutton Maddock, Corfham in Diddlebury, Wrockwardine & Cheswardine, Shropshire, England, at age 29.2,4
2 CONT *'''Family      Mary FitzAlan''' d. 29 Aug 1396
2 CONT *'''Children
2 CONT **Sir John le Strange, 5th Baron Strange of Blackmere+11,4 b. c 1353, d. 3 Aug 1375
2 CONT **Agnes Strange+ b. c 1359
2 CONT **Ankaret le Strange+2,12,13,3,4,5,7,8 b. c 1361, d. 1 Jun 1413
