2 CONT *'''     Sir John le Strange, 5th Baron Strange of Blackmere was born circa 1353 at of Blackmere, Shropshire, England; Age 7 on 15 Aug 1360.7,1,8,4 He married Isabel de Beauchamp, daughter of Sir Thomas de Beauchamp, 11th Earl of 
2 CONC Warwick, Sheriff of Worcestershire, Warwickshire, & Leicestershire, Marshal of England and Katherine de Mortimer, before 3 November 1362; They had 1 daughter (Elizabeth, wife of Sir Thomas de Mowbray, Duke of Norfolk, Earl Marshal
2 CONC  & Nottingham).7,1,8,2,3,4 Sir John le Strange, 5th Baron Strange of Blackmere died on 3 August 1375; d.p.m; died a minor.9,1,8,4
2 CONT *'''Family      Isabel de Beauchamp d. 29 Sep 1416
