2 CONT *'''John de Bohun, 5th Earl of Hereford1
2 CONT *'''M, #106943, b. 23 November 1306, d. 20 January 1336
2 CONT *Last Edited=12 May 2015
2 CONT *Consanguinity Index=0.03%
2 CONT *'''     John de Bohun, 5th Earl of Hereford was born on 23 November 1306.1 He was the son''' of Humphrey de Bohun, 4th Earl of Hereford and Lady Elizabeth Plantagenet.1 '''He married Lady Alice FitzAlan''', daughter of Edmund Fit
2 CONC zalan, 2nd/9th Earl of Arundel and Alice de Warenne, '''in 1325.2 He married Margaret Basset''', daughter of Sir Ralph Basset, 2nd Lord Basset of Drayton and Joan de Grey.1 '''He died on 20 January 1336 at age 29.1
2 CONT *'''     He gained the title of 5th Earl of Hereford.1 He gained the title of 4th Earl of Essex.1
2 CONT *Citations
