2 CONT **	i)          ENEAS de Bohun ([1313/15]-Kimbolton [29 Sep] 1331, bur Walden Abbey).  A manuscript which narrates the descents of the founders of Lanthony Abbey names (in order) “Margareta…Humfredus…Johannes…Humfredus decimus…Edwa
