2 CONT ----
2 CONT Elizabeth de Segrave was born on 25 October 1338 at Croxton Abbey, Leicestershire, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was the daughter of John de Segrave, 4th Baron of Segrave and Margaret Marshall Plantagenet, Duchess of Norfolk.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married John Mowbray, 4th Lord Mowbray (son of John de Mowbray, 3rd Lord Mowbray and Lady Joan Plantagenet, circa 1349).
2 CONT
2 CONT She died before 1368, according to most sources. Her death date is variously reported as 1367, 1375, 1398, and 1399 as well, including the specific date 3/24/1399.
2 CONT
2 CONT From circa 1349, her married name became Mowbray.
2 CONT
