2 CONC bray (1340-1368) 25 March 1349 . Notable ancestors include Henry II of England (1133-1189), William I of England (1027-1087), Charlemagne (747-814), Hugh Capet (c940-996), Alfred the Great (849-899), Rurik (c832-879). Ancestors ar
2 CONC e from the United Kingdom, France, Germany, Spain, Russia, Ukraine, Belgium, Byzantium, the Netherlands, England, the Byzantine Empire, Italy.
