2 CONT # [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Amadeus_VIII,_Duke_of_Savoy#Later_life Later life]
2 CONT # [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Amadeus_VIII,_Duke_of_Savoy#Marriage_and_issue  Marriage and issue]
2 CONT
