1 NOTE {geni:about_me} John, Duke of Berry
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT Family and Children
2 CONT
2 CONT John of Berry had the following issue by his first wife, Joanna of Armagnac (1346–1387):
2 CONT
2 CONT Charles of Berry, Count of Montpensier (1362–1382)
2 CONT
2 CONT John de Valois, Count of Montpensier, (1363–1402), married Princess Catherine of France, daughter of Charles V, King of France
2 CONT
2 CONT Louis of Berry (1364–1383)
2 CONT
2 CONT Bonne of Berry (1365–1435), married Amadeus VII of Savoy and Bernard VII, Count of Armagnac
2 CONT
2 CONT Marie of Berry, Duchess of Auvergne (1367–1434), married: 1) Louis III of Châtillon, 2) Philip of Artois, Count of Eu; 3) John I, Duke of Bourbon
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Joanna_of_Armagnac
2 CONT
2 CONT Jeanne of Armagnac
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT   (Redirected from Joanna of Armagnac)
2 CONT
2 CONT Jump to: navigation, search
2 CONT
2 CONT Joanna/Jeanne of Armagnac
2 CONT
2 CONT Duchess of Berry
2 CONT
2 CONT Joanna, John and their children
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse 	John, Duke of Berry
2 CONT
2 CONT Issue
2 CONT
2 CONT Charles of Berry, Count of Montpensier
2 CONT
2 CONT John of Berry, Count of Montpensier
2 CONT
2 CONT Louis of Berry
2 CONT
2 CONT Bonne, Countess of Savoy
2 CONT
2 CONT Marie, Duchess of Auvergne
2 CONT
2 CONT House 	House of Armagnac (by birth)
2 CONT
2 CONT House of Valois (by marriage)
2 CONT
2 CONT Father 	John I of Armagnac
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother 	Beatrice of Clermont
2 CONT
2 CONT Born 	24 June 1346
2 CONT
2 CONT Died 	1387
2 CONT
2 CONT Joanna or Jeanne of Armagnac (24 June 1346 – 1387) was a French noblewoman of the powerful Armagnac family, being the eldest daughter of Count John I of Armagnac and his wife Beatrice of Clermont. She became Duchess of Berry by he
2 CONC r marriage to John, Duke of Berry.
2 CONT
2 CONT [edit] Marriage and issue
2 CONT
2 CONT She married John, Duke of Berry, son of John II of France and his first wife Bonne of Bohemia. Joanna and John had five children:
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Charles of Berry, Count of Montpensier (1362–1382)
2 CONT
2 CONT     * John de Valois, Count of Montpensier, (1363–1402), married Princess Catherine of France, daughter of Charles V, King of France
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Louis of Berry (1364–1383)
2 CONT
