2 CONT '''F, #19236, b. August 1380, d. 2 October 1422'''
2 CONT '''Father'''	Philip II 'the Bold', Duke of Burgundy b. 15 Jan 1342, d. 27 Apr 1404
2 CONT '''Mother'''	Marguerite de Dampierre b. 13 Apr 1350, d. 16 Mar 1405
2 CONT Charts	14 Generation Pedigree of George III, King of Great Britain & Ireland (#1)
2 CONT 14 Generation Pedigree of George III, King of Great Britain & Ireland (#2)
2 CONT 14 Generation Pedigree of Friedrich Wilhelm III, King of Prussia
2 CONT '''Mary of Burgundy was born in August 1380 at Burgundy. She married Amadeus VIII (Pope Felix V), Duke of Savoy''', son of Amadeus VII 'the Red', Duke of Savoy and Bonna du Berry, '''in May 1401. Mary of Burgundy died on 2 October
2 CONC  1422 at Savoy at age 42.'''
2 CONT '''Family	Amadeus VIII (Pope Felix V), Duke of Savoy''' b. 4 Sep 1383, d. 7 Jan 1451
2 CONT '''Children	'''
