1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Richard_of_Brittany
2 CONT
2 CONT Richard, Count of Montfort, Vertus and Étampes (c. 1396 – 2 June 1438) was the 8th child and youngest son of John V, Duke of Brittany, and his third wife, Joan of Navarre. Not much is known of his life, except that he was the fath
2 CONC er of Francis II, Duke of Brittany. In his lifetime he held many titles and positions; he was appointed captain-general of Guyenne and Poitou in 1419, became comte d'Etampes and seigneur de Palluau et de Châteaumur de Thouarcé, de
2 CONC  Bourgomeaux-l'Evêque et de Ligron on 8 May 1423, and Count of Mantes in October 1425.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/BRITTANY.htm
