2 CONT *'''     Edmund de Mortimer, 3rd Earl of March was born on 1 February 1352 at Llangoed, Llyswen, Breconshire, Wales.2 He was the son''' of Roger de Mortimer, 2nd Earl of March. '''He married Philippa Plantagenet, Countess of Ulste
2 CONC r''', daughter of Lionel of Antwerp, 1st Duke of Clarence and Lady Elizabeth de Burgh, '''circa May 1368 at Reading Abbey, Queen's Chapel, Reading, Berkshire, England.3 He died on 27 December 1381 at age 29 at Dominican Priory, Co
2 CONC rk, County Cork, Ireland.
2 CONT *'''     He gained the title of 3rd Earl of March.1
2 CONT *'''Children of Edmund de Mortimer, 3rd Earl of March and Philippa Plantagenet, Countess of Ulster
