3 TEXT 	Elizabeth was the wife of Edmund de Mortuo Mari, knight, before her marriage to the earl, and had issue by him Roger de Mortuo Mari, earl of March, deceased, whose issue was Edmund de Mortuo Mari, now earl of March, aged 21 years
4 CONC  and more [b. abt 1351], her kinsman and heir.
