2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth was the daughter and heir to Sir Edmund de Mortimer, Earl of March and descendant of King Edward III and Philippe of Antwerp. Granddaughter of Sir Roger de Mortimer and Philippe de Montagu, Lionel of Antwerp, Duke of Cla
2 CONC rence and Elizabeth de Burgh, daughter of Sir William.
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife of Sir Henry "Hotspur' Percy, son of Sir Henry de Percy and Margaret de Neville.
2 CONT They were married before 10 Dec 1379, and two children:
2 CONT Sir Henry, Knight of the Garter, Earl of Northumberland
2 CONT Elizabeth who married Sir John Clifford
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir Henry was slain at the Battle of Shrewsbury in 1403 and buried at York Cathedral.
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth married a second time, after June 03,1406, as his second wife to Sir Thomas Camoys, son and heir to Sir John Camoys. They had one son, Sir Roger Camoys.
