1 NOTE 4TH EARL OF MARCH & ULSTER; DECLARED HEIR BY RICHARD II; KILLED
1 NOTE 4th Earl of March. Lord Lieutenant of Ireland. Slain at Kenlis. [GADD.GED]
2 CONT
2 CONT Declared Heir to the throne of England. Also related to Roger Mortimer of Wigmore who had been guardian in 1313 to Isabel St. Leger, later Lady de Hoo, and was Regent of England. [THELMA.GED]
