1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/ENGLAND,%20Kings%201066-1603.htm#BlancheLancasterdied1369
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT "Blanche of Lancaster, Duchess of Lancaster (25 March 1345 – 12 September 1368) was an English noblewoman and heiress, daughter of England's wealthiest and most powerful peer, Henry of Grosmont, 1st Duke of Lancaster. She was the 
2 CONC first wife of John of Gaunt, 1st Duke of Lancaster, and the mother of King Henry IV of England."
2 CONT
