2 CONT Blanche of Lancaster Memorial
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth: 	Mar. 25, 1345 Lincolnshire, England Death: 	Sep. 30, 1369 Staffordshire, England
2 CONT
2 CONT English nobility, the daughter of Henry of Grosmont, Duke of Lancaster and Isabel Beaumont. Some sources say she was born March 25, 1345. She married John of Gaunt on May 19, 1359 at Reading. The couple had seven children, includi
2 CONC ng the future King Henry IV and Philippa, Queen of Portugal. Blanche died of plague at Bolingbroke Castle at the age of 29. Geoffrey Chaucer's original poem "The Book of the Duchess" was written as a eulogy for Blanche. (bio by: K
2 CONC risten Conrad) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Family links: 
2 CONT  Parents:
2 CONT   Henry of Lancaster (1310 - 1361)
2 CONT   Isabel de Beaumont (____ - 1361)
2 CONT
