2 CONT    John of Gaunt (1340 - 1399)*
2 CONT
2 CONT  Children:
2 CONT   Philippa of Lancaster (1360 - 1415)*
2 CONT   Elizabeth Lancaster (1363 - 1425)*
2 CONT    Henry IV (1367 - 1413)*
2 CONT
2 CONT  Sibling:
2 CONT   Maud of Lancaster (1339 - 1362)*
2 CONT   Blanche of Lancaster (1345 - 1369)
2 CONT
