1 NOTE Governess to the Duke's daughter by his first wife, she became John's mistress in 1388. All of their children were born before their marriage. They were later legitimized by the Pope. Her birthplace has also been recorded as Hauna
2 CONC ult, Belgium.
2 CONT
2 CONT Catherine's sister, Phillipa, married Geoffrey Chaucer, the author of "The Canterbury Tales." Duke John and Geoffrey Chaucer were very good friends.
