2 CONT *'''Henry Beaufort, Bishop of Lincoln, Winchester, Cardinal St. Eubesius1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8
2 CONT *'''M, #10738, b. circa 1374, d. 11 April 1447
2 CONT *Father	Sir John 'of Gaunt' Plantagenet, 1st Duke of Lancaster, King of Castile and Leon, Earl of Derby, Lincoln, Leicester, & Richmond9,10,6,11,12 b. Mar 1340, d. 3 Feb 1399
2 CONT *Mother	Katherine Roet9,10,6,11,12 b. 25 Nov 1340, d. 10 May 1403
2 CONT *'''     Henry Beaufort, Bishop of Lincoln, Winchester, Cardinal St. Eubesius''' married '''Alice FitzAlan''', daughter of Sir Richard FitzAlan, 11th Earl Arundel, 10th Earl of Surrey, Chief Butler of England, Admiral of the West 
2 CONC and Elizabeth de Bohun, '''DID NOT MARRY; They had 1 illegitimate daughter''' (Joan/Jane, wife of Sir Edward Stradling).13,4,6,7,14 '''Henry Beaufort, Bishop of Lincoln, Winchester, Cardinal St. Eubesius was born circa 1374 at Cha
2 CONC teau de Beaufort, Meuse, France.7,8 He left a will on 20 January 1446.6,7,8 He wrote a codicil on 7 April 1447.6,7,8 He wrote a codicil on 9 April 1447.6,7,8 He died on 11 April 1447 at Wolvesey Palace, Winchester, Hampshire, Engl
2 CONC and; Buried in chantry chapel, Winchester Cathedral.3,6,7,8 His estate was probated on 11 September 1447.6,7,8
2 CONT *'''Family     Alice FitzAlan b. c 1373, d. b 13 Oct 1415
2 CONT *Child	
2 CONT **Joan Beaufort+3,6,7,8 b. c Jan 1392, d. 19 Oct 1479
