2 CONT *[S18] Matthew H.C.G., editor, Dictionary of National Biography on CD-ROM (Oxford, U.K.: Oxford University Press, 1995), reference: "Beaufort, HEnry de". Hereinafter cited as Dictionary of National Biography.
