2 CONT *'''Henry BEAUFORT (Cardinal)
2 CONT *'''Born: ABT 1376, Chateau de Beauf, Meuse-et-Loire, France
2 CONT *'''Christened: Chateau de Beauf, Meurthe-et-Mosel, Anjou, France
2 CONT *'''Died: 11 Apr 1447, Winchester, Hampshire, England
2 CONT *'''Buried: Winchester Cathe, Hampshire, England
2 CONT *'''Notes: Prebendary of Thame, 1389. Prebendary of Sutton in the Cathedral, 1391. Dean of Wells, 1397. Bishop of Lincoln. Bishop of Winchester. Lord Chancellor.
2 CONT *Father: John "of Gaunt" PLANTAGENET (1º D. Lancaster)
2 CONT *Mother: Catherine De ROET SWYNFORD
2 CONT *'''Associated with: Alice FITZALAN
2 CONT *Children:
2 CONT **1. Jane BEAUFORT
2 CONT *From: http://www.tudorplace.com.ar/BEAUFORT.htm#Henry BEAUFORT (Cardinal) ____________________
2 CONT *'''Cardinal Henry Beaufort
2 CONT *'''Birth: 	c. 1374  Departement de la Haute-Loire, Auvergne, France
2 CONT *'''Death: 	Apr. 11, 1447, Winchester, Hampshire, England
2 CONT *'''Cardinal Bishop of Winchester completed the building of the cathedral itself after being largely rebuilt from Norman times by William of Wykeham. Beaufort was the illegitimate''' son of John of Gaunt and Catherine Swyneford. '
2 CONC ''He crowned Kenry VI King of France in 1431 in Paris'''. (bio by: Connie Nisinger) 
