3 NOTE Amazing!   Great work.    Funnily enough, I have only very recently had Holland family connections coming thru (Geni) -- quite a bit on the other ancients, before now, but this categorising puts those into context ( I have been re
4 CONC ading up on the intense life of Roger de Mortimer, along  with roused curiosity on those medieval characters!)    Did you notice that we are listed as 16th cousins with only ONE removal !   It could make sense among those lists.
