1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT
2 CONT "Lady Eleanor de Bohun (c. 1366 – 3 October 1399) was the elder daughter and co-heiress with her sister, Mary de Bohun, of their father Humphrey de Bohun, 7th Earl of Hereford. Her mother was Lady Joan Fitzalan, daughter of Richar
2 CONC d FitzAlan, 10th Earl of Arundel and his second wife Eleanor of Lancaster."
2 CONT
