1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Gaspard "the Moewer bastard" Forstmeister von Wurttemberg https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Duchy_of_W%C3%BCrttemberg "The forester (forstmeister), a position created around 1410, was in charge of the forests in his di
2 CONC strict, enforcing the laws governing the forest that covered such things as logging and hunting. Often, he came into conflict with the citizenry, who resented the increasing taxes and restrictions placed on the forest's use."
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Profile Photo is of his Father, Ulrich V, Count of Württemberg''' https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ulrich_V,_Count_of_W%C3%BCrttemberg
2 CONT
2 CONT '''An illegitimate son of Count Ulrich V of Württemberg, he was working as Stuttgart's forest master in 1474.''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT Information on descendents of Kaspar Mower/'the Bastard'/Forstmeister was found here:
