2 CONT ==Helena von Württemberg
2 CONT '''Birth	1457'''
2 CONT '''Stuttgart, Stadtkreis Stuttgart, Baden-Württemberg, Germany'''
2 CONT '''Death	19 Feb 1506 (aged 48–49)'''
