2 CONT '''Burial	Stiftskirche St. Peter und Paul'''
2 CONT '''Öhringen, Hohenlohekreis, Baden-Württemberg, Germany'''
2 CONT Find a Grave Memorial ID: 158558287
2 CONT '''Helene von Wurttemberg married Kraft VI, Graf zu Hohenlohe on 26 February 1476, in Waldenburg, Öhringen, Württemberg, Germany. They were the parents of at least 9 sons and 6 daughters. She died on 19 February 1506, in Jagstkrei
2 CONC s, Württemberg, Germany, at the age of 49, and was buried in Heilbronn, Baden-Württemberg, Germany.'''
