2 CONT
2 CONT *'''Margrave of Brandenburg:''' Reign 1323–1351
2 CONT >'''Predecessor:''' [http://www.geni.com/people/Louis-IV-Holy-Roman-Emperor/4202780705000039134 Louis IV] '''Successor:''' [http://www.geni.com/people/Ludwig-VI-von-Wittelsback/6000000002188383227 Louis VI the Roman]
2 CONT
2 CONT *'''Duke of Bavaria Reign:''' 1347–1349 with [http://www.geni.com/people/Stephan-II-Herzog-von-Bayern-Ingolstadt/6000000006727832747 Stephen II], [http://www.geni.com/people/Ludwig-VI-von-Wittelsback/6000000002188383227 Louis VI],
2 CONC  [http://www.geni.com/people/Willem-I-van-Beieren/6000000000468305114 William I], [http://www.geni.com/people/Albrecht-I-von-Wittelsbach-Duke-of-Bavaria/6000000003858624547 Albert I] and [http://www.geni.com/people/Otto-V-von-Baye
2 CONC rn/6000000002188383187 Otto V]	
2 CONT >'''Predecessor:''' [http://www.geni.com/people/Louis-IV-Holy-Roman-Emperor/4202780705000039134 Louis IV] '''Successor:''' partitioned into Upper and Lower Bavaria
2 CONT
2 CONT *'''Duke of Upper Bavaria:''' Reign 1349–1361 with [http://www.geni.com/people/Ludwig-VI-von-Wittelsback/6000000002188383227 Louis VI] and[http://www.geni.com/people/Otto-V-von-Bayern/6000000002188383187 Otto V] 
2 CONT >'''Predecessor:''' created from Bavaria '''Successor:''' [http://www.geni.com/people/Meinhard-III-von-Bayern/6000000002503655436 Meinhard III]
2 CONT
2 CONT *'''Count of Tyrol:''' Reign 1342–1361 co-ruler of Margarete Maultasch
2 CONT >'''Predecessor:''' [http://www.geni.com/people/Margarete-von-Gortz/6000000001562994828 Margarete Maultasch] '''Successor:''' [http://www.geni.com/people/Meinhard-III-von-Bayern/6000000002503655436 Meinhard III]
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Louis V, called the Brandenburger (May 1315 – 18 September 1361), a member of the House of Wittelsbach, ruled as Margrave of Brandenburg from 1323 to 1351 and as Duke of Bavaria from 1347 until his death. From 1342 he also was co-
2 CONC ruling Count of Tyrol by his marriage with the Meinhardiner countess Margaret.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Louis_V,_Duke_of_Bavaria
