2 CONC tage Family Trees] via wife [http://www.geni.com/profile-34670946528 Christina Krieger (born Von Allen)] by [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Mar 8 2015, 14:56:02 UTC'''''''''''
