2 CONT *'''Landgrave of Thuringia'''  Reign 17. September 1482 – 26. August 1486
2 CONT >'''Predecessor:'''  [http://www.geni.com/people/index/6000000003858686083 William III] '''Successor:''' [http://www.geni.com/people/index/6000000006727794221 Frederick VI]
