1 NAME Eleanor /Stewart/
2 GIVN Eleanor
2 SURN Stewart
2 _MARNM Stewart
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 26 OCT 1427
2 PLAC Perth, Perthshire, Scotland
2 ADDR
1 DEAT
