2 CONT *Phillippa PLANTAGENET (Queen of Portugal)
2 CONT *Born: 31 Mar 1360, Leicester Castle, Leicester, England
2 CONT *Died: 19 Jul 1415, Odivellas, Lisbon
2 CONT *Buried: Batalla Abbey, Portugal
2 CONT *Notes: died of the plague. The Complete Peerage vol.VII,p.415,note g.
2 CONT *Father: John "of Gaunt" PLANTAGENET (1º D. Lancaster)
2 CONT *Mother: Blanche PLANTAGENET
2 CONT *Married: Joao I "o falso" of Aviz (King of Portugal) 14 Feb 1387, Oporto Cathedral, Portugal
2 CONT *Children:
2 CONT **1. Branca De AVIZ (b. 1378)
2 CONT **2. Beatriz PINTO (B. Strange of Blackmere) (b. ABT 1386) (m.1 Gilbert Talbot of Irchingfield - m.2 Thomas Fettiplace of East Shefford)
2 CONT **3. Branca De AVIZ (b. 13 Jul 1388)
2 CONT **4. Alfonzo De AVIZ (b. 30 Jul 1390)
2 CONT **5. Duarte of Portugal (King of Portugal) (b. 31 Oct 1391)
2 CONT **6. Pedro De AVIZ of Combrie (Regent) (b. 9 Dec 1392)
2 CONT **7. Henry "the Navigator" De AVIZ (D. Viseu) (b. 4 Mar 1394 - d. 1460)
2 CONT **'''8. Isabella De AVIZ''' (b. 21 Feb 1397) '''(m. Phillip III "the good", D. Burgundy)
2 CONT **9. Branca De AVIZ (b. 1398)
2 CONT **10. Joao De AVIZ (Grand Master of Santiago) (b. 13 Jan 1400)
2 CONT **11. Fernando De AVIZ (Grand Master of Aviz) (b. 29 Sep 1402)
2 CONT *From: http://www.tudorplace.com.ar/PLANTAGENET2.htm#Phillippa PLANTAGENET (Queen of Portugal) __________________
