2 CONT '''Jacqueline of Holland'''1,2,3
2 CONT Last Edited	4 Sep 2011
2 CONT F, #41515, '''b. 16 July 1401, d. 9 October 1436'''
2 CONT '''Father'''	Wilhelm VI, Count of Holland, Hennegau, Seeland, & Straubing, Lord of Arkel4,5,2,3 b. 5 Apr 1365, d. 31 May 1417
2 CONT '''Mother'''	Margarethe de Burgundy4,2,3 b. 22 Oct 1374, d. 8 Mar 1441
2 CONT '''     Jacqueline of Holland was born on 16 July 1401 at Le Quesnoy, Nord, Nord-Pas-de-Calais, France.4,2,3 She and Jean, Duke de Torraine, Berry obtained a marriage license on 22 April 1411; Date of Dispensation for being relate
2 CONC d in the 3rd and 4th degrees.3 Jacqueline of Holland married Jean, Duke de Torraine, Berry,''' son of Charles VI 'the Mad', King of France and Isabeau of Bavaria, '''on 6 August 1415 at Den Haag, Netherlands.6,2 Jacqueline of Holl
2 CONC and married Johann IV, Duke of Brabant & Limburg, Markgraf von Antwerp & Namur,''' son of Anton, Duke of Brabant & Limburg, Markgraf von Antwerp, Count of Rethel and Jeanne de Luxembourg, '''on 10 April 1418 at Den Haag, Netherlan
2 CONC ds.1,2,3 Jacqueline of Holland married Sir Humphrey Plantagenet, Duke of Gloucester, Earl of Pembroke,''' son of Henry IV Plantagenet, King of England, Earl of Derby, Hereford, & Northampton, Lord of Brecon & Hay and Mary de Bohun
2 CONC , '''before 9 February 1423; They had no issue.7,2,3 Jacqueline of Holland and Sir Humphrey Plantagenet, Duke of Gloucester, Earl of Pembroke were divorced on 13 January 1425. Jacqueline of Holland and Sir Humphrey Plantagenet, Du
2 CONC ke of Gloucester, Earl of Pembroke were divorced on 9 January 1428; Marriage declared void by Pope Martin V.5,2,3 Jacqueline of Holland married Frank II, Graf von Ostervant, Herr von St. Maartendijk, Scherpenisse, Zuijlen, Gorinch
2 CONC em, Leerdam, & Schoonrewoerd,''' son of Sir Floris von Borsselen, Herr von St. Maartensdijk and Oda von Bergen, '''on 1 July 1432 at Den Haag, Netherlands; Secretly married this date. They had no issue.8,9,3 Jacqueline of Holland 
2 CONC married Frank II, Graf von Ostervant, Herr von St. Maartendijk, Scherpenisse, Zuijlen, Gorinchem, Leerdam, & Schoonrewoerd,''' son of Sir Floris von Borsselen, Herr von St. Maartensdijk and Oda von Bergen, '''on 1 March 1434 at St
2 CONC . Maartensdijk; Officially married this date.8 Jacqueline of Holland died on 9 October 1436 at Teilingen Castle, Sassenheim, South Holland, Netherlands, at age 35; Buried at Den Haag, Netherlands.'''4,2,3
2 CONT '''Family 1'''
2 CONT '''Jean, Duke de Torraine, Berry''' b. 31 Aug 1398, d. 5 Apr 1417
2 CONT '''Family 2'''
2 CONT '''Johann IV, Duke of Brabant & Limburg, Markgraf von Antwerp & Namur''' b. 11 Jun 1403, d. 17 Apr 1427
2 CONT '''Family 3'''
