1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Please see Peter Bartrum: St. John 1; https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000173427359964 & Marchudd 13 (A); https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000173427421915 (Steven Ferry, December 24, 202
2 CONC 4.)
