2 CONT
2 CONT Nobility. Born the youngest daughter of Rudolf III and Barbara of Liegnitz. She married Johann von Brandenburg in 1416 and bore him four children. After his death she retired to Bayreuth. She was the first noble to be buried in th
2 CONC is church, 155 years before the vault was established as burial place for the Margraves.
2 CONT
