2 CONT *House of Brunswick:
2 CONT **Magnus II, (b. 1328) 
2 CONT *Son of Magnus II: 
2 CONT **Bernard I 1388-1409 
2 CONT *Son of Bernard I: 
2 CONT **Frederick II the Pious 
2 CONT *Son of Frederick II:
2 CONT **Otto V,  "The Magnanimous" (b. 1439) 
2 CONT **Henry I of Lüneburg, (b. 1468, d. 1532) 
2 CONT *Son of Henry I: 
2 CONT **Ernest I the Confessor, (b. 1497, d. 1546)
