2 CONT *''''''     Elizabeth Tuchet was the daughter of James Tuchet, 5th Lord Audley (of Heleigh) and Eleanor de Holland.1,2 She married, firstly, Edward Brooke, 6th Lord Cobham (of Kent), son of Sir Thomas Brooke and Joan Braybroke, Ba
2 CONC roness Cobham (of Kent).1 She married, secondly, Christopher Worsley before 8 November 1464.2
2 CONT *''''''     Her married name became Brooke.1 Her married name became Worsley.
