2 CONT
2 CONT =============================================================
2 CONT
2 CONT "Joan Beaufort (c. 1404 – 15 July 1445) was the Queen Consort of Scotland from 1424 to 1437 as the spouse of King James I of Scotland. During part of the minority of her son James II (from 1437 to 1439), she served as the Regent o
2 CONC f Scotland."
2 CONT
2 CONT She married secondly to James Stewart, the Black Knight of Lorn (m. 1439; her death 1445)
2 CONT
