3 CONT Tomb of John Beaufort, 1st Duke of Somerset and his wife Margaret, in Wimborne Minster, Dorset. He married Margaret Beauchamp (c. 1410 – before 3 June 1482) daughter of Sir John Beauchamp, de jure 3rd Baron Beauchamp of Bletsoe, a
3 CONC nd his second wife, Edith Stourton. 
3 CONT
3 CONT Arms of Beauchamp of Bletsoe: Gules, a fess between six martlets or. 
3 CONT
3 CONT Photo by memorino, posted on Wikipedia.
3 CONT
