2 CONT *'''     Alice Montagu, Countess of Salisbury was born in 1407 at Salisbury, Wiltshire, England.3 She was the daughter''' of Thomas Montagu, 4th Earl of Salisbury and Eleanor de Holand.1 '''She married Richard de Neville, 5th Earl
2 CONC  of Salisbury''', son of Ralph de Neville, 1st Earl of Westmorland and Lady Joan de Beaufort, '''before February 1421 at Salisbury, Wiltshire, England.3 She died before 9 December 1462 at Bisham, Berkshire, England.3
2 CONT *'''     She gained the title of Countess of Salisbury, suo jure.2 Her married name became de Neville.
