2 CONC RICHARD Duke of York & his wife Cecily Neville of Westmoreland (Dublin Castle 21 Oct 1449-murdered Tower of London 18 Feb 1478, bur Tewkesbury Abbey, Gloucestershire).  He was created Earl of Salisbury and Earl of Warwick 25 Mar 1
