2 _MARNM Tiptoft
2 NICK [born: Joyce de Cherleton]; Lady Joyce Tiptoft; Baroness Tiptoft;
1 NAME Lady Joyce Tiptoft (de Cherleton)
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 23 OCT 1403
