2 CONT *◦Sir John Tiptoft, 1st Earl of Worcester, 2nd Lord Tiptoft, Lord High Treasurer, Constable of England & the Tower of London17,18,14,4,5,9 b. 8 May 1427, d. 18 Oct 1470
