2 CONT
2 CONT John married Joyce CHERLETON (See Link for Ancestry),2 daughter of (Sir) Edward DE CHERLETON K.G., 5th Lord Cherleton of Powys and Eleanor DE HOLAND, after 28 Feb 1421.2 Joyce was born about 1403 in Powys Castle, Welshpool, Montgo
2 CONC meryshire, Wales, died 22 Sep 1446 in Enfield, Edmonton, Middlesex, England 2 about age 43, and was buried in Enfield, Edmonton, Middlesex, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT The Child from this marriage was:
2 CONT
2 CONT 10.	i.  	Joyce DE TIPTOFT 266 269 was born about 1430 in Worcestershire, England and died circa 1470 of Dudley, Staffordshire, England 269 about age 40. 
