1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *'''Sir Thomas Neville, Chief Steward of Durham1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8,9
2 CONT *'''M, #47015, d. 22 February 1459
2 CONT *Father      Sir John Neville, Captain of Verneuil, Keeper of Roxburgh Castle1,10,11 b. c 1387, d. c 20 May 1420
2 CONT *Mother     Elizabeth Holand1,10,11 b. c 1388, d. 4 Jan 1423
2 CONT *'''     Sir Thomas Neville, Chief Steward of Durham married Elizabeth Beaumont, daughter of Sir Henry Beaumont, 5th Lord Beaumont and Elizabeth Willoughby, after 7 November 1436; They had 2 sons (Sir Humphrey; & Charles). He also
2 CONC  had an illegitimate son (Sir George).12,2,3,6,7 Sir Thomas Neville, Chief Steward of Durham left a will on 16 January 1459.3,7 He died on 22 February 1459 at of Brancepeth, Durham, England.12
2 CONT *'''Family 1 
2 CONT *Child
2 CONT **Sir George Neville+3,4,5,7,8,9 d. a 17 Sep 1517
2 CONT *'''Family 2      Elizabeth Beaumont d. 20 Jul 1447 or 27 Jul 1447
