2 CONT Erich I Herzog von Braunschweig-Grubenhagen was born circa 1380. He was the son of Albrecht II Herzog von Braunschweig-Grubenhagen and Agnes I von Braunschweig. He married Elisabeth von Braunschweig-Göttingen, daughter of Otto II 
2 CONC Herzog von Braunschweig-Göttingen and Margareta von Jülich-Berg, circa July 1405. He died on 28 May 1427. He gained the title of Herzog von Braunschweig-Grubenhagen.
2 CONT
