2 CONT In Leipzig on 19 November 1460 Ernst, Elector of Saxony married with Elisabeth of Bavaria-Munich. They had seven children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Margarete (b. Meissen, 4 August 1469 - d. Weimar, 7 December 1528), married on 27 February 1487 to Duke Heinrich of Brünswick-Lüneburg.
2 CONT
2 CONT Henry I of Lüneburg
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT Henry the Middle, Duke of Brunswick-Lüneburg (b. 1468, d. 1532) was Prince of Lüneburg from 1486 to 1520.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT
2 CONT Henry and Margaret of Saxony (1469-1528) had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Anne (1492-??)
2 CONT
2 CONT Elisabeth (1494-1572) m. Charles, Duke of Guelders (1467-1538)
2 CONT
2 CONT Otto (1495-1549)
2 CONT
2 CONT Ernest I the Confessor (1497-1546)
2 CONT
2 CONT Apollonia (1499-1571)
2 CONT
2 CONT Anne (1502-1568) m. February 2, 1525 Barnim XI of Pommern (1501-1573)
2 CONT
2 CONT Franz (1508-1549)
