2 CONT '''Meinhard V, Count of Gorizia''' (b. after 1297 - d. after 1318) was a member of the Albertine line of the House of Gorizia. He was a son of Count Henry III and his first wife Beatrix dei Camerino.
2 CONT
2 CONT Little is known about his life. He was probably co-ruler with his father. Around 1314, his father negotiated Meinhard's marriage with a daughter of king James II of Aragon.[1]
