2 CONT Agnes Neuchâtel  formerly De Neuchatel  aka de Neufchâtel  Born about 1194 in Neuchatel, Neuchatel, Switzerland  Ancestors  Daughter of Ulric de (de NeuChatel) Neuchâtel  and Yolande (Urach) de Neufchâtel   [sibling(s) unknown]  W
2 CONC ife of Pierre (Grandison) de Grandison  - married 1229 in Neuchâtel,Neuchâtel Canton,,Switzerland   Descendants  Mother of Amadeus S de Grandison  and William (Grandison) de Grandison   Died 1263 in England   
2 CONT
