2 CONT ===Comments 
2 CONT
2 CONT This profile was updated 18 August 2023.  Changes:
2 CONT
2 CONT * A previous version of this profile wrote that  he had married  Blanche de Savoie (1267-1323)  https://www.geni.com/people/Blanche-de-Savoie-Vaud-dame-de-Grandson/6000000003649673450.  But she was the wife of https://www.geni.com
2 CONC /people/Pierre-II-seigneur-de-Grandson/6000000015026649857?through=6000000003649673450
2 CONT * He did not have the title “William de Grandison, Sieur de Grandison & de Ste. Croix”
2 CONT * He was more likely not  the son of https://www.geni.com/people/Amadeus-de-Grandison/6000000006906787448?through=6000000002378364475 but rather, they were brothers.  
2 CONT * His vital statistics previously showed as: birth: circa 1262 Harpenden, Hertfordshire, England  Death:	June 27, 1335 (68-77)  Lambourn, Hungerford, Berkshire, England  Place of Burial:	Dore Abbey, Sussex, England. The dates have
2 CONC  stayed the same but locations have been conformed to current sources.
2 CONT * a first marriage to Jeannette de Gruyère and their children added, as per the studies at https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/ENGLISHNOBILITYMEDIEVAL3D-K.htm#KatherineGrandsonMWilliamMontagu
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Grandison and Tregoz
2 CONT
