2 CONT 2.         JORDANE de Grandson (-10 Dec ---).  Her parentage and marriages are shown in Europäische Stammtafeln[766], but the primary source which confirms this information has not been identified.   The necrology of Bonmont recor
2 CONC ds the death 10 Dec of “Jordana domina de Villar” and her donation[767].  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' firstly AIMON [III] de la Tour, son of GIROLD [I] Seigneur de la Tour & his wife --- (-20 Sep 1276).  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' secondly (after 1276) as his second wife, HUMBERT [III] Seigneur de Thoire et Villars Seigneur d’Aubonne, son of ETIENNE [II] Seigneur de Thoire et Villars & his wife Beatrix de Faucigny ([after 1235]-14 May 1301, bur Sain
2 CONC t-Claude). 
