0 @N6000000004303404248@ NOTE Alasia, daughter of Tommaso I, Marquis of Saluzzo (Piedmont). [Burke's Peerage]
1 CONT
1 CONT -------------------
1 CONT
1 CONT He [Richard FitzAlan] married, before 1285, Alasia, daughter of Tommaso I, Marquis of Saluzzo in Piedmont [1244-99], by Luisa, daughter of Giorgio, Marquis of Ceva. She died 25 September 1292, and was buried at Todingham Priory. H
1 CONC e died 9 March 1301/2, in his 36th year, and was buried with his ancestors. [Complete Peerage I:240, (transcribed by Dave Utzinger)]
1 CONT
1 CONT -------------------
1 CONT
1 CONT Children
1 CONT 1.	 Eleanor FitzAlan b: ABT 1285 in Arundel, Sussex, England
1 CONT 2.	 Edmund FitzAlan , 9th Earl of Arundel b: 1 MAY 1285 in Marlborough Castle, Wiltshire, England
1 CONT 3.	 Alice Arundel b: 1289 in Arundel, Sussex, England
1 CONT 4.	 Margaret FitzAlan b: BEF 1292 in Arundel, Sussex, England
