0 @N6000000000337389299@ NOTE Weis, p. 30; 82:  8th Earl of Arundel - Knighted 22 May 1306;  M. P. 1306;  beheaded at Hereford, 17 November 1326.  
1 CONT
1 CONT Source #2:  Douglas Richardson, "Plantagenet Ancestry:  A Study in Colonial and Medieval Families" (Baltimore, Maryland:  Genealogical Publishing Company, Inc., 2004), pp. 110, 316-317
