1 CONT 25 Jan 1327. Accedes to the throne after his father Edward II is deposed by his Queen Isabella and Roger de Mortimer.
1 CONT 1330. Takes power after 3 years of government by his mother, Isabella, and Roger de Mortimer. Executes Roger.
