1 CONC keningen der graven en gravinnen uit het henegouwsche huis (1924), vol. 1 + Chancery records + F. C. Hingeston-Randolph, ed., The register of Walter de Stapeldon, bishop of Exeter (1892) + Rymer, Foedera, new edn + L. Devillers, e
1 CONC d., Cartulaire des comtes de Hainaut, de l'avenement de Guillaume II a la mort de Jacqueline de Baviere, 6 vols. (1881-96) + CEPR letters, vols. 2-4 + C. R. L. Fletcher and others, eds., Collectanea: first series, OHS, 5 (1885) + 
1 CONC J. R. Magrath, The Queen's College, 1 (1921) + Chronique de Jean le Bel, ed. J. Viard and E. Deprez, 2 vols. (Paris, 1904-5) + Chroniques de J. Froissart, ed. S. Luce and others, 15 vols. (Paris, 1869-1975) + M. C. B. Dawes, ed., 
1 CONC Register of Edward, the Black Prince, PRO, 4 (1933) + Oeuvres, ed. K. de Lettenhove and A. Scheler, 28 vols. (Brussels, 1867-77) + The lyric poems of Jehan Froissart, ed. R. R. McGregor jun. (1975) + H. S. Lucas, The Low Countries
1 CONC  and the Hundred Years' War, 1326-1347 (1929) + M. A. Michael, 'A manuscript wedding gift from Philippa of Hainault to Edward III', Burlington Magazine, 127 (1985), 582-98 + Tout, Admin. hist., vol. 5 + J. Vale, Edward III and chi
