1 CONT Child 2: Plantagenet, Elizabeth of Lancaster, b. 1364
1 CONT Child 3: Plantagenet, John, b. BEF 4 MAY 1366
1 CONT Child 4: Plantagenet, Edward, b. 1364
1 CONT Child 5: Plantagenet, John
1 CONT Child 6: Plantagenet, Henry IV, King of England, b. 30 MAY 1366
