1 CONT U.K.: The Bodley Head, 1999), page 113. Hereinafter cited as Britain's Royal 
1 CONT Family.</span></div>
1 CONT <div align="left"><span style="font-size:12pt">&#160;&#160; 2. [S6] G.E. Cokayne; with Vicary Gibbs, H.A. Doubleday, Geoffrey H. White, 
1 CONT Duncan Warrand and Lord Howard de Walden, editors, The Complete Peerage of 
1 CONT England, Scotland, Ireland, Great Britain and the United Kingdom, Extant, Extinct or 
1 CONT Dormant, new ed. , 13 volumes in 14 (1910-1959; reprint in 6 volumes, Gloucester, 
1 CONT U.K.: Alan Sutton Publishing, 2000), volume I, page 357. Hereinafter cited as The 
1 CONT Complete Peerage.</span></div>
1 CONT <div align="left"><span style="font-size:12pt">&#160;&#160; 3. [S6] Cokayne, and others, The Complete Peerage, volume II, page 388.</span></div>
1 CONT <div align="left"><span style="font-size:12pt">&#160;&#160; 4. [S11] Alison Weir, Britain's Royal Family, page 115.</span></div>
1 CONT <div align="left"><br />
1 CONT </div>
