0 @N6000000002188309004@ NOTE Charles VI of France
1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
1 CONT
1 CONT Charles VI the Mad
1 CONT King of France (more...)
1 CONT Reign 16 September 1380 – 21 October 1422
