1 CONT Vaqueiras, Raimbaut de. The Epic Letter (external link to bilingual tex
1 CONT Villehardouin, Geoffrey de, The Conquest of Constantinople, in Joinville and Villehardouin, Chronicles of the Crusades, 1963, ISBN 0-14-044124-7 
1 CONT [edit]
