0 @N6000000005076715771@ NOTE Marguerite de Flandre, Comtesse de Flandre was born on 13 April 1350.4 She was the daughter of Louis II de Mâle, Comte de Flandre and Marguerite de Brabant.1,3 She married, firstly, Philippe I de Bourgogne, Duc de Bourgogne, son o
1 CONC f Philippe de Bourgogne, Comte de Boulogne and Jeanne de Boulogne, Comtesse d'Auvergne et de Boulogne, in 1356.3 She married, secondly, Philippe II de Valois, Duc de Bourgogne, son of Jean II, Roi de France and Bonne Judith de Lux
1 CONC embourg, on 19 June 1369.4 She died on 16 March 1405 at age 54.4
1 CONT      Marguerite de Flandre, Comtesse de Flandre gained the title of Comtesse de Flandre.
1 CONT Children of Marguerite de Flandre, Comtesse de Flandre and Philippe II de Valois, Duc de Bourgogne
