0 @N6000000002188108569@ NOTE Elizabeth Plantagenet
1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
1 CONT
1 CONT Elizabeth Plantagenet (1364 - 1426) was the third child of John of Gaunt, 1st Duke of Lancaster and Blanche of Lancaster. In 1380 she married John Hastings, 3rd Earl of Pembroke. This marriage was annulled in 1383. In 1386 she mar
1 CONC ried John Holland, 1st Duke of Exeter. After his death in 1400, the same year she married Sir John Cornwall, 1st Baron Fanhope and Milbroke.
1 CONT
1 CONT With John Holland she had five children:
1 CONT
1 CONT 1. Richard Holland (c. 1386 - September 3, 1400)
1 CONT
1 CONT 2. Constance Holland (1387 - 1437) who married Thomas Mowbray, 4th Earl of Norfolk and Sir John Grey
1 CONT
1 CONT 3. Alice Holland (c. 1392 - c. 1406) who married Richard De Vere, 11th Earl of Oxford
1 CONT
1 CONT 4. John Holland, 2nd Duke of Exeter(1395 - 1447)
1 CONT
1 CONT 5. Sir Edward Holland (1399 - 1413)
1 CONT
1 CONT With John Cornwall she had two children:
1 CONT
1 CONT 1. Constance Cornwall (c. 1401 - c. 1427) who married John Fitzalan, 14th Earl of Arundel
1 CONT
1 CONT 2. John Cornwall (b. 1404)
