0 @N6000000002187564432@ NOTE 1336  Albrecht of Aichelberg receives the local rule over Koengen  
1 CONT http://translate.google.com/translate?hl=en&sl=de&u=http://geschichtsverein-koengen.de/OrtChronologie.htm&prev=/search%3Fq%3DAlbrecht%2Bvon%2BAichelberg%26hl%3Den%26lr%3D
0 @N6000000002187564412@ NOTE the heiress of Koengen.
1 CONT Source: http://translate.google.com/translate?hl=en&sl=de&u=http://www.schillerstadt-marbach.de/buergerinfo/news/print_news.php3%3Fnews_id%3D214&prev=/search%3Fq%3DGuta%2BThumb%2Bof%2BNeuburg%26hl%3Den%26lr%3D%26rls%3DGGLG,GGLG:20
1 CONC 05-32,GGLG:en
1 CONT
1 CONT ---------------------------
1 CONT Anna countess of Aichelberg extends the existing castle plant. Castle and house of countess Anna formed the core of a plant, which expanded in the course of the years to attention ordering attachment. On the nearly thick foundatio
1 CONC n walls rose a roomy vierfluegliges half timbered house , whose timberwork consisted of enormous, roughly behauenen oak trunks. The discharge of an artificial lake fed by sources filled the three meters of deep ditches, which prot
1 CONC ected the lock all around. From the village side one entered the castle over a powerful zugbruecke. The entire plant was surrounded by a wall. 
