1 CONT 1298–1307 Succeeded by:
1 CONT Friedrich II 
1 CONT Preceded by:
1 CONT Rudolph I Duke of Austria
1 CONT Co-rulers:
1 CONT Rudolph II (1282-1290)
1 CONT Rudolph III 1298-1307) Succeeded by:
1 CONT Frederick I
1 CONT and
1 CONT Leopold I 
