0 @N6000000002187742910@ NOTE Henry Beaufort, 2nd Earl of Somerset
1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
1 CONT
1 CONT Henry Beaufort, 2nd Earl of Somerset (November 26 (probable), 1401 - November 25, 1418) was the eldest son of John Beaufort, 1st Earl of Somerset, and the grandson of John of Gaunt and Katherine Swynford.
1 CONT
1 CONT Henry succeeded his father as Earl of Somerset on March 16, 1410. He never married, and was himself succeeded by his younger brother, John Beaufort, 1st Duke of Somerset.
1 CONT
