1 CONT of the Roses, between the houses of York and Lancaster. During the next 16
1 CONT years Margaret used the financial and military assets of the Lancasters to
1 CONT ensure succession of her son to the throne. By 1461, she was forced to go to
1 CONT France to seek financial aid, but her son was killed in 1471 and she was
1 CONT imprisoned by Louis XI and ransomed for surrender of French territories.
